u0:U0_0000027 skos:definition "Characterisation without permission or acceptance.";
  skos:prefLabel "Non-Authoritative Characterisation" .

<https://ontology.engender.co.za/semstack/u1> skos:definition "u1 defines contract profiles, rules, gates, and declared completeness boundaries. u1 permits or forbids but does not accept.";
  skos:prefLabel "Semantic Stack u1 - Agreement Layer" .

<https://ontology.engender.co.za/semstack/u3> skos:definition "u3 defines canonical forms, variants, and governed mappings. u3 may evolve rapidly but must not weaken u0 invariants and must not introduce agreement or acceptance semantics.";
  skos:prefLabel "Semantic Stack u3 - Patterns and Mapping Layer" .

u1:U1_0000018 skos:definition "In layer u1 (Agreement/Proposal (non-authoritative proposals for governance consideration)), 'Token Schema' is an datatype property relating u1:U1_0000014 to xsd:string. It does not imply acceptance, eligibility, approval, or truth.";
  skos:prefLabel "Token Schema" .

u1:U1_0000019 skos:definition "In layer u1 (Agreement/Proposal (non-authoritative proposals for governance consideration)), 'MetadataOnly' is an individual value used within this layer's governance/assurance vocabulary. It does not imply acceptance, eligibility, approval, or truth.";
  skos:prefLabel "MetadataOnly" .

u1:U1_0000020 skos:definition "In layer u1 (Agreement/Proposal (non-authoritative proposals for governance consideration)), 'ReadOnly' is an individual value used within this layer's governance/assurance vocabulary. It does not imply acceptance, eligibility, approval, or truth.";
