  skos:prefLabel "Claim Permission Value" .

u1:U1_0000029 skos:definition "In layer u1 (Agreement/Proposal (non-authoritative proposals for governance consideration)), 'AgentExecuted' is an individual value used within this layer's governance/assurance vocabulary. It does not imply acceptance, eligibility, approval, or truth.";
  skos:prefLabel "AgentExecuted" .

u1:U1_0000030 skos:definition "In layer u1 (Agreement/Proposal (non-authoritative proposals for governance consideration)), 'HumanExecuted' is an individual value used within this layer's governance/assurance vocabulary. It does not imply acceptance, eligibility, approval, or truth.";
