u1:U1_0000031 skos:definition "In layer u1 (Agreement/Proposal (non-authoritative proposals for governance consideration)), 'MixedHITL' is an individual value used within this layer's governance/assurance vocabulary. It does not imply acceptance, eligibility, approval, or truth.";
