u1:U1_0000043 skos:definition "In layer u1 (Agreement/Proposal (non-authoritative proposals for governance consideration)), 'Exec Policy Requires HITL Point' is an object property relating u1:U1_0000009 to u3:U3_0000036. It does not imply acceptance, eligibility, approval, or truth.";
  skos:prefLabel "Exec Policy Requires HITL Point" .

u1:U1_0000049 skos:definition "In layer u1 (Agreement/Proposal (non-authoritative proposals for governance consideration)), 'Profile Requires Mapping' is an object property relating u1:U1_0000013 to u3:U3_0000005. It does not imply acceptance, eligibility, approval, or truth.";
  skos:prefLabel "Profile Requires Mapping" .

u1:U1_0000052 skos:definition "In layer u1 (Agreement/Proposal (non-authoritative proposals for governance consideration)), 'Ruleset Has Gate' is an object property relating u1:U1_0000015 to u1:U1_0000010. It does not imply acceptance, eligibility, approval, or truth.";
  skos:prefLabel "Ruleset Has Gate" .

u1:U1_0000054 skos:definition "In layer u1 (Agreement/Proposal (non-authoritative proposals for governance consideration)), 'Proposal Authored By' is an object property relating u0:U0_0000058 to u0:U0_0000008. It does not imply acceptance, eligibility, approval, or truth.";
  skos:prefLabel "Proposal Authored By" .

u2:U2_0000006 skos:definition "Closed outcome set for an eligibility decision. Values are expressed as controlled individuals.";
  skos:prefLabel "Eligibility Outcome" .

u2:U2_0000104 skos:definition "Links an acceptance decision record to an accepted-in-system assertion artefact whose promotion is authorized by the decision. This is a governance relation, not a mechanism step.";
  skos:prefLabel "Decision Authorizes Accepted Assertion" .

u2:U2_0000124 skos:definition "Links an acceptance decision record to a specific proposal artefact that is being decided upon. This linkage exists to support auditability and enforce separation of duties.";
  skos:prefLabel "Decision Acts On Proposal" .

u3:U3_0000014 skos:definition "In layer u3 (Mapping (mapped structural workflow constructs and participation; non-executive; non-governance)), 'Mapping Constraint' is an object property relating <https://ontology.engender.co.za/semstack/u3#U3_0000005> to <https://ontology.engender.co.za/semstack/u3#U3_0000002>. It represents mapped structure only; it does not represent execution and confers no governance authority.";
  skos:prefLabel "Mapping Constraint" .

u3:U3_0000002 skos:definition "In layer u3 (Mapping (mapped structural workflow constructs and participation; non-executive; non-governance)), 'Constraint Overlay' is a class used to represent a first-class construct on this layer's semantic axis. It represents mapped structure only; it does not represent execution and confers no governance authority.";
  skos:prefLabel "Constraint Overlay" .

u3:U3_0000023 skos:definition "In layer u3 (Mapping (mapped structural workflow constructs and participation; non-executive; non-governance)), 'Version Supersedes' is an object property relating <https://ontology.engender.co.za/semstack/u3#U3_0000007> to <https://ontology.engender.co.za/semstack/u3#U3_0000007>. It represents mapped structure only; it does not represent execution and confers no governance authority.";
  skos:prefLabel "Version Supersedes" .

u3:U3_0000041 skos:definition "In layer u3 (Mapping (mapped structural workflow constructs and participation; non-executive; non-governance)), 'Workflow Has Mapping' is an object property relating <https://ontology.engender.co.za/semstack/u3#U3_0000037> to <https://ontology.engender.co.za/semstack/u3#U3_0000005>. It represents mapped structure only; it does not represent execution and confers no governance authority.";
  skos:prefLabel "Workflow Has Mapping" .

<https://ontology.engender.co.za/semstack/u4> skos:definition "u4 introduces governed execution semantics (managed agent operations) and minimal outcome-evidence hooks. u4 MUST NOT imply real-world success; it represents attempts, controls, observations, escalations, and evidence needed to substantiate outcome claims.";
  skos:prefLabel "Semantic Stack u4 - Execution and Outcome Evidence Layer" .

u4:U4_0000014 skos:definition "In layer u4 (Execution (execution attempt, control, escalation, and observation artefacts; no governance effect)), 'Run End Time' is an datatype property relating u4:U4_0000008 to xsd:dateTime. It records attempts and observations only; completion or presence has no governance or promotion effect.";
  skos:prefLabel "Run End Time" .

u4:U4_0000015 skos:definition "In layer u4 (Execution (execution attempt, control, escalation, and observation artefacts; no governance effect)), 'Run Start Time' is an datatype property relating u4:U4_0000008 to xsd:dateTime. It records attempts and observations only; completion or presence has no governance or promotion effect.";
